1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,080
Now it's time to eat breakfast so some people in different parts of the world they may skip breakfast.
现在该吃早餐了。世界上一些地方的人可能会不吃早餐。

2
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:14,800
Or they might fast but I normally like to eat breakfast because I don't want to leave the house on an empty stomach.
或者他们会禁食，但我通常喜欢吃早餐，因为我不想空着肚子出门。

3
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:23,320
So in order to make breakfast I will go to my fridge open it and see what kind of food I have.
所以为了做早餐，我会走到冰箱前，打开冰箱，看看自己有什么食物。

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:31,600
I normally don't like to eat a typical american breakfast that consists of eggs bacon grits and sausage.
我通常不喜欢吃那种由鸡蛋、培根、玉米糁粥和香肠组成的典型美式早餐。

5
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:40,480
I like eating fruits and veggies or I like eating stuff from different cultures like anpa which I'm going to make right now.
我喜欢吃水果和蔬菜，或者不同文化里的食物，比如 anpa，我现在就要做。

6
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:51,280
Normally it takes me around 10 to 15 minutes to make breakfast but let me know down below if you guys eat breakfast or do you fast and skip breakfast.
通常做早餐要花我十到十五分钟。你们是吃早餐，还是禁食、不吃早餐？在下面告诉我。

7
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:24,799
After eating breakfast it's time to make the bed because it's ms excuse me I have to make the bed buddy.
吃完早餐就该铺床了，因为它是 ms……不好意思，小家伙，我得铺床。

8
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:41,280
The cat doesn't like when I make the bed I just made the bed and I like making my bed every morning because I like starting off.
猫不喜欢我铺床。我刚把床铺好了，而且我喜欢每天早上铺床，因为我喜欢开始一天时……

9
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:47,359
My day with a clean room so my bed looks clean everything looks so organized.
……房间是整洁的。所以我的床看起来很干净，所有东西都很有条理。

10
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:54,280
And now I can finally start my day but I'm still in my pajamas and now I have to get dressed.
现在我终于能开始一天了，但我还穿着睡衣，现在得换衣服了。

11
00:01:54,280 --> 00:02:00,600
But I won't get dress to go to work I will get dressed in athletic ge because I'm going to the gym.
但我不是换上班的衣服；我会换上 athletic ge，因为我要去健身房。

12
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:07,239
But before going to the gym let me know down below in the comments if you make your bed every morning.
不过去健身房前，先在下面评论告诉我，你们是不是每天早上都铺床。

13
00:02:07,239 --> 00:02:11,799
I just walked to the gym and right now I'm inside the gym.
我刚走到健身房，现在已经在健身房里面了。

14
00:02:11,799 --> 00:02:18,239
So I try to go to the gym almost every day but sometimes I can't go because life does get busy.
我尽量几乎每天都去健身房，但有时去不了，因为生活确实会忙起来。

15
00:02:18,239 --> 00:02:24,799
But today I'm here at the gym to exercise and work out so I'll do some physical activity.
不过今天我在健身房锻炼、健身，所以我会做些身体活动。

16
00:02:24,799 --> 00:02:29,960
By the way if you guys haven't watched my video about gym vocabulary go ahead and check it out.
顺便说，如果你们还没看过我那期健身房词汇视频，就去看看。

17
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:36,359
Because I recorded that in this same gym I usually work out for around 1 hour.
因为那期也是在这家健身房拍的。我通常锻炼大约一小时。

18
00:02:36,359 --> 00:02:45,320
And I like going to the gym because it makes me feel strong I get stronger I build my muscles and I feel good I look good.
我喜欢去健身房，因为它让我觉得强壮。我变得更强、锻炼肌肉，也感觉不错、看起来不错。

19
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:50,919
And it makes me feel less lazy so I'll work out for 1 hour and then I'll head home.
而且让我觉得没那么懒散。所以我会锻炼一小时，然后回家。

20
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:57,040
Woo I just finished working out I'm all sweaty I burned some calories and also.
呼，我刚锻炼完，满身是汗，消耗了些热量，而且……

21
00:02:57,040 --> 00:03:03,040
I feel a little bit sore and now I have to go walk home and then go to work.
……我还有点肌肉酸痛。现在我得走回家，然后去工作。

22
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:10,150
But I'm still wearing my gym clothes so when I go home I will take a quick shower because I can't work in my gym clothes.
但我还穿着运动服，所以回家后会快速冲个澡，因为不能穿着这套运动服工作。

23
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:13,030
And then I'll get dressed and go to work.
然后我会换好衣服去工作。

24
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:20,040
I just got out of the shower and when you take a shower you bathe yourself with soap and water.
我刚洗完澡。洗澡就是用肥皂和水清洗身体。

25
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:26,199
And as you can see I have a towel wrapped around my head because I still need to dry my hair.
你们可以看到我头上裹着毛巾，因为我还得把头发弄干。

26
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:32,629
Now I'm almost ready to go to work but I still need to put on makeup on my face.
现在我差不多准备好工作了，不过还得在脸上化妆。

27
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:38,720
So this is a very important step to my day because I like to look nice and professional when I go to work.
这是我一天里很重要的一步，因为工作时我喜欢看起来得体、专业。

28
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:42,199
And it's an important part of women's daily routines.
她说，这也是女性日常安排中的重要一环。

29
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:51,040
Now it's time to go to work and you might be wondering adan where do you work as an english teacher do you work in an office.
现在该工作了。你们可能在想：adan，你是英语老师，在哪里工作？是在办公室吗？

30
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:54,239
Do you have another job what do you normally do.
你还有别的工作吗？平常都做什么？

31
00:03:54,239 --> 00:03:59,479
Well this is actually my workspace I work on my computer I work from home.
其实，这就是我的工作空间。我用电脑工作，我在家办公。

32
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:07,079
So I basically edit all of my videos here and I spend a lot of time editing my videos also here I write my scripts.
所以我基本上在这里剪辑所有视频，花很多时间剪视频，也在这里写脚本。

33
00:04:07,079 --> 00:04:14,680
I brainstorm ideas and I not only sit inside my house I go to places to teach all of you guys english.
我构思点子，也不只是待在屋里；我还会去不同地方教大家英语。

34
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:22,200
And I'll be doing that in this video where I'll go to a park and I'll ask people what does their daily routine look like every day.
这期我也会这样做：去公园问大家每天的日常安排是什么样的。
